  emotionalLine: Comfortably modern
  shortDescription: Those who love nature appreciate sustainability and authenticity,
    including at home. A modern design featuring straight lines and hearty wooden
    tones creates a feeling of harmony and connection with nature. It lets you enjoy
    every day consciously.A bold finish. The new Bergamo oak reproduction has a natural,
    highly modern effect thanks to its elegant vertical grain. Large fronts put an
    additional emphasis on the look. The ultramatt taupe grey acts as a gentle contrast,
    while the taupe grey worktop with its basalt-like fibre blends in as the perfect
    match.
